<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cost Plus downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cost Plus downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said analysts Alan Rifkin and Subhaash Kumar downgraded Cost Plus Inc to neutral from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said in a report stock had risen 36 percent since Piper initiated coverage on April 28.</p>
<p>-- said &quot;although we believe that the fundamental business remains very much intact at Cost Plus, we are somewhat more cautious today than when we initiated.&quot;</p>
<p>-- stock was off two at 21-1/4.</p>
</text>
